              { textOffset: 173, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 460, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
            ],
            textPool: "Howdy.\u0000Thanks for dropping by.  My bad back and I were getting a little \nimpatient.\u0000#0Do you know what's going on?\u0000~0#1Who are you?\u0000~0#2Why are you here?\u0000.\u0000Who is Derrida?\u0000Where is Derrida?\u0000~0Strange, I was going to ask you that.\u0000~1I'm Gehrmond, one of the three founders of Genoq.  I'm retired now.\u0000~2My brother asked me to come here.  Said he wanted to bring me in on something.  Must have been awfully important -- usually he only calls me on my birthday.\u0000#3What was so important?\u0000Derrida?  I don't know.  My brother hired him a few years ago for some special research.  Put him on some huge salary.  Never met him.  So that's what I know.\u0000Last I heard, he works somewhere in this building, but don't quote me on that.\u0000~3I wish I knew.  But I'll give you even odds that it was some new shady deal.  The scoundrels he's been dealing with lately.  I don't know...\u0000",
          },
