            replies: [
              { textOffset: 36, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 229, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 247, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 354, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 582, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 740, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
              { textOffset: 1275, responses: [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], nextTopics: [6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0] },
            ],
            textPool: "Oh no.  You're the courier, right?\u0000#2Yes.\u0000~2It's about time you got here!  I've had Derrida screaming in my ear all day, and now this whole place is going crazy.  I don't know what's in that package, but it better be important!\u0000#0Who is Derrida?\u0000#1What's going on here?\u0000~0A doctor, a scientist.  I don't know.  Does this look like an information booth?\u0000Where is Derrida?\u0000~1I've been waiting for someone to tell me.  I haven't talked to  anybody in a couple of hours. ^1You know, it doesn't make any sense.  I tried the telephone, the Net, the emergency line, and they're all dead.\u0000Where is Derrida?\u0000From what I've heard he's somewhere on the top floor.  But with this security system and all, you haven't got a chance of reaching him now.\u0000I need to know how to get there.\u0000Hey, listen:  Don't even try to get that package to him now.  I've heard stories about what they make up there.  Viruses, instant Alzheimer's, things that could mess you up for life. ^1You seem like a nice enough guy.  Stay here.  It can't be too long before someone on the outside figures out what's going on. ^0You're not much of a hero, but Derrida, whoever he is, needs the package.  And there must be more people trapped up there who need help.  You put any fear behind you and decide to push on.\u0000I'm going to find Derrida.\u0000~0~1~2Suit yourself.  It's your life.  Just do me a favor and get me out of here.\u0000",
          },
        },
      ],
